<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3874/79  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8738/48  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.1114/24  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5285/90  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     38.69/73   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.3215/35  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1831.1/2.6 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     118.14/19  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     8.0500/75  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.6966/44  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.1379/99  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.5849/59</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$319.50/00</p>
</text>
